  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the Thai eggplant and cook until it starts to soften, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the rice and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the vegetable broth, tomato paste, lime juice, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve hot."
